#*: lingua fallāx nōn amat vēritātem et os '''lūbricum''' operātur ruīnās
#*:: ''A deceitful tongue loveth not truth: and a '''slippery''' mouth worketh ruin.''
#*::: (trans.: Douay-Rheims Bible)
# [[hazardous]], [[unsteady]]
# [[tricky]]

